Chosen over adding an icon package as a dependency: this project has added exactly
one frontend dependency since phase 1 (`@tanstack/react-virtual`, itself a flagged
deviation — see docs/decisions.md), and four small glyphs don't clear that bar.
None of the four icons copied here are among the handful of Lucide icons derived
from the Feather project (which carry an additional MIT notice in Lucide's own
LICENSE file) — these four are ISC-only.
